{"version":1,"content":"<p>【PHP 困境 😓】作為支撐全球高達 7 成網站運作的核心程式語言，開源專案 PHP 近日爆發兩項 9.2 分嚴重安全漏洞導致全球大亂。</p><p>非謀利組織「PHP 基金會」（PHP Foundation）執行總監 Elizabeth Barron 近日接受路透社專訪時透露，基金會目前長期處於「資金短缺」的窘境，全組織僅有 1 名全職員工，在 AI 工具帶動程式碼提案暴增的衝擊下，修補漏洞的工作已逼近極限。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:33.526764+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:14:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T23:38:10.497528+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:18:49.538619+00:00","content_hash":"f87284f625ed479750ce121f6942f55614b28a407fa0f29006db286c4b30cbd0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}